### ARPDAU decomposition

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["First 30d<br/>ARPDAU $0.354"] --> B["Mix effect<br/>−$0.081"]
    B --> C["Within-tier effect<br/>+$0.023"]
    C --> D["Last 30d<br/>ARPDAU $0.296"]

    classDef metric fill:#f6f8fa,stroke:#57606a,color:#24292f;
    class A,B,C,D metric;
```

> The decomposition is descriptive. Daily ARPDAU follows the 15-day sale cycle, so days are not independent; uncertainty comes from a player-level Poisson bootstrap (1,000 draws). Within-tier effect 95% CI: −$0.006 to +$0.053.

